"override its behavior via `extra_config`, e.g:"
msgstr "要强制 `GdsBackend` 出于任何原因不使用 libcufile API，您可以通过 `extra_config` 覆盖其行为，例如："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/gds.rst:150
msgid ""
"Note that under this mode it would still use CUDA APIs to map and do "
"operations the pre-registered GPU memory."
msgstr "请注意，在此模式下，它仍将使用 CUDA API 来映射和操作预注册的 GPU 内存。"

